	(descr "TE 6437288-5 SUPERSEAL 1.0 60-pos right-angle header, 4 rows, 3 mm pitch, gold, lower lock. Hole pattern: 34-pos grid (pins 1-34) plus 26-pos grid (pins 35-60) at 38.5 mm section pitch. Pad XY, 1.3 mm drill and 2.3 mm pads follow the drawing-based SuperSeal footprint digitized from TE customer drawing ENG_CD_9-1437287-8 (the 26-pos section drawing TE publishes with the 6437288 family) and the matching 34-pos grid. Three NPTH mounting holes 3.4 mm. Body extents match the catalog 78 mm length. JPN_CD_6437288-5 could not be downloaded from TE in this environment (Akamai denied). Confirm cavity-1 mark against that drawing before a production loom.")
